.dev.vars
# Licensed content that must never be published. The SPIN is used under a
# written licence that restricts it to one password-protected instance; its items are supplied to the Worker as a secret and must not
# be committed. See the "Restricted instruments" section of SELF_HOSTING.md.
restricted/

# Wrangler's local cache. It holds the Cloudflare account id and name, and a
# captured request trace with the IP geolocation and TLS fingerprints of
# whoever last ran wrangler locally. None of it belongs in a public repo,
# and a copy under public/ would be served to the world.
.wrangler/
public/.wrangler/
